    {
      "id": "maps-in-the-collections-framework",
      "heading": "Maps in the Collections Framework",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Although maps are not a part of the Collection interface, they are closely related. Maps store data as key-value pairs and are fully integrated with the framework."
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 27,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "key-map-implementations",
